Dear Aarav,

On behalf of **Marketing Kernal Private Limited**, we are thrilled to extend this formal offer of employment for the position of **Senior AI Growth Engineer & GEO Strategist**.

We were deeply impressed by your technical proficiency, strategic vision in generative discovery architectures, and cultural alignment with Marketing Kernal's mission to pioneer the next generation of digital marketing.

=== Summary of Terms & Compensation

- *Position Title:* Senior AI Growth Engineer & GEO Strategist
- *Department:* Artificial Intelligence & Search Innovation
- *Reporting To:* Head of Engineering & Strategy
- *Work Mode:* Hybrid / Remote-First with flexible core hours
- *Commencement Date:* December 1, 2026
- *Annual Cost to Company (CTC):* INR 18,00,000 (Eighteen Lakhs Rupees Only) per annum, structured as per company compensation standards, inclusive of performance bonuses and health coverage.

=== Key Responsibilities

1. Lead development and fine-tuning of internal AI automation pipelines for LLM brand citation analysis.
2. Formulate algorithmic strategies for Entity SEO and Generative Engine Optimization across international enterprise accounts.
3. Collaborate directly with executive leadership to evaluate emerging multimodal search patterns.

=== Acceptance Process

Please confirm your formal acceptance by signing and dating this document below and returning a scanned copy within five (5) business days.

We look forward to welcoming you to the Marketing Kernal team as we build the future of AI-driven visibility!

